        {"zh": "我贴着泥底过去。", "en": "I'm moving along the muddy bottom."},
        {"zh": "水草挡住了它的视线。", "en": "The weeds block its view."},
        {"zh": "我再游近一点。", "en": "I'll swim a bit closer."},
        {"zh": "它的影子在水底。", "en": "Its shadow is on the bottom."},
        {"zh": "我的鳍不敢动太快。", "en": "I don't dare work my fins too fast."},
