        {"zh": "我甩尾巴打过去。", "en": "I lashed out with my tail."},
        {"zh": "这一下几乎没力气。", "en": "That had almost no force."},
        {"zh": "我咬住了它的手指。", "en": "I bit its finger."},
        {"zh": "我被水推开了。", "en": "The water pushed me off."},
        {"zh": "我赶紧游了开去。", "en": "I swam away quickly."},
